            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BH4. </span><span class="Qtxt">In what day, month and year was <span class="REF">~~BH1~~</span> born?</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">What is her birthday?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
