              <p><span class="Qnum">BH10. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Hubo otros nacimientos vivos entre <span class="REF">~~prevname~~</span> y <span class="REF">~~BH1~~</span>, incluidos niños que murieron después del nacimiento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.BH11
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BH11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Have you had any live births since the birth of ~~BH1(CM11)~~?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">BH11. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha tenido algún nacimiento vivo desde el nacimiento de ~~BH1(CM11)~~?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.DB2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DB2. </span><span class="Qtxt">When you got pregnant with <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, did you want to get pregnant at that time?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DB2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando quedaste embarazada de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, ¿querías quedar embarazada en ese momento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.DB4
    conditions:
      - logic: CM11=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DB4A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you want to have a baby later on, or did you not want any children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DB4A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Querías tener un bebé más adelante o no querías tener hijos?</span></p>
      - logic: CM11>1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DB4B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you want to have a baby later on, or did you not want any more children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DB4B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Querías tener un bebé más adelante o no querías tener más hijos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you see anyone for antenatal care during your pregnancy with <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN2. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Consultó a alguien para recibir atención prenatal durante su embarazo con <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Whom did you see?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe for the type of person seen and record all answers given.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN3. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿A quién viste?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue el tipo de persona vista y registre todas las respuestas dadas.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN4AU
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN4. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many weeks or months pregnant were you when you first received antenatal care for this pregnancy?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer as stated by respondent.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If '9 months or later' record '209'</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'DK' record '998'</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN4. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas semanas o meses de embarazo tenía cuando recibió atención prenatal por primera vez para este embarazo?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre la respuesta tal como la expresó el encuestado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si '9 meses o más' registre '209'</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'DK' registra '998'</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN4AN
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN4. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many weeks or months pregnant were you when you first received antenatal care for this pregnancy?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer as stated by respondent.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If '9 months or later' record '209'</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'DK' record '998'</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN4. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas semanas o meses de embarazo tenía cuando recibió atención prenatal por primera vez para este embarazo?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre la respuesta tal como la expresó el encuestado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si '9 meses o más' registre '209'</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'DK' registra '998'</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN5. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times did you receive antenatal care during this pregnancy?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe to identify the number of times antenatal care was received. If a range is given, record the minimum number of times antenatal care received.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '98' for Don't know.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces recibió atención prenatal durante este embarazo?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda para identificar el número de veces que se recibió atención prenatal. Si se proporciona un rango, registre el número mínimo de veces que recibió atención prenatal.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '98' para No sé.</span></p>
  - name: MN6
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">MN6. </span><span class="Qtxt">As part of your antenatal care during this pregnancy, were any of the following done at least once:</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">MN6.</span><span class="Qtxt">Como parte de su atención prenatal durante este embarazo, ¿se realizó alguna de las siguientes acciones al menos una vez?</span><p></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN6A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Was your blood pressure measured?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le midieron la presión arterial?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN6B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you give a urine sample?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le diste una muestra de orina?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN6C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you give a blood sample?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le diste una muestra de sangre?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN6D
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">Listen to your baby’s heartbeat?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D]</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Escuchar los latidos del corazón de tu bebé?</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN6E
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">Talk with you about which foods or how much food you should eat?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E]</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Hablar contigo sobre qué alimentos o cuánta comida debes comer?</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN6F
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[F] </span><span class="Qtxt">Talk with you about breastfeeding?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[F]</span><span class="Qtxt">¿Hablamos con usted sobre la lactancia materna?</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN6G
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[G] </span><span class="Qtxt">Ask if you had vaginal bleeding?</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[G]</span><span class="Qtxt">Preguntar si tuvo sangrado vaginal.</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN16
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN16. </span><span class="Qtxt">During the pregnancy with <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, did you take SP/Fansidar to keep <u>you</u> from getting malaria?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN16. </span><span class="Qtxt">Durante el embarazo con <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, ¿tomó SP/Fansidar para evitar <u>usted</u> contraer malaria?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN17. </span><span class="Qtxt">How many times did you take SP/Fansidar during your pregnancy with <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '98' for Don't know.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN17. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántas veces tomó SP/Fansidar durante su embarazo con <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '98' para No sé.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN18
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you get the SP/Fansidar during an antenatal care visit, during another visit to a health facility or at another source?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN18. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Recibió SP/Fansidar durante una visita de atención prenatal, durante otra visita a un centro de salud o de otra fuente?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN19
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN19. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who assisted with the delivery of <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe for the type of person assisting and record all answers given.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">If respondent says no one assisted, probe to determine whether any adults were present at the delivery.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN19. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién ayudó con la entrega de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Investigue el tipo de persona que ayudó y registre todas las respuestas dadas.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Si el encuestado dice que nadie ayudó, indague para determinar si hubo adultos presentes en el parto.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN20
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Where did you give birth to <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe to identify the type of place.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>If unable to determine whether public, private, or NGO</u>, write the name of the place and then temporarily record '76' until you learn the appropriate category for the response.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN20. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Dónde diste a luz a <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda para identificar el tipo de lugar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>Si no puede determinar si es público, privado u ONG</u>, escriba el nombre del lugar y luego registre temporalmente '76' hasta que aprenda la categoría apropiada para la respuesta.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN21
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN21. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> delivered by caesarean section? That is, did they cut your belly open to take the baby out?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN21. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿<span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> nació por cesárea? Es decir, ¿te abrieron el vientre para sacar al bebé?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN22
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN22. </span><span class="Qtxt">When was the decision made to have the caesarean section?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe if necessary: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was it before or after your labour pains started?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN22. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuándo se tomó la decisión de realizarme la cesárea?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondee si es necesario: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Fue antes o después de que comenzaran sus dolores de parto?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN23
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN23. </span><span class="Qtxt">Immediately after the birth, was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> put directly on the bare skin of your chest?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If necessary, show the picture of skin-to-skin position.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN23. </span><span class="Qtxt">Inmediatamente después del nacimiento, ¿se colocó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> directamente sobre la piel desnuda de su pecho?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es necesario, muestra la imagen de la posición piel con piel.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN24
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN24. </span><span class="Qtxt">Before being placed on the bare skin of your chest, was the baby wrapped up?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN24. </span><span class="Qtxt">Antes de colocarlo sobre la piel desnuda de su pecho, ¿estaba el bebé envuelto?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN25
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN25. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> dried or wiped soon after birth?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN25. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se secó o se secó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> poco después del nacimiento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN26U
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN26. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after the birth was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> bathed for the first time?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'Immediately' or less than 1 hour, record '000'.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than 24 hours, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If '1 day' or 'next day', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">About how many hours after the delivery?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If '24 hours', probe to ensure best estimate of less than 24 hours or 1 day.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 24 hours or more, record days</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'Never bathed', record '997'.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'DK / Don't remember', record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN26. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después del parto se bañó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> por primera vez?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es 'Inmediatamente' o menos de 1 hora, registre '000'.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si son menos de 24 horas, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si '1 día' o 'día siguiente', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Aproximadamente cuántas horas después del parto?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es '24 horas', investigue para garantizar que la mejor estimación sea menos de 24 horas o 1 día.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si son 24 horas o más, registre los días</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'Nunca se bañó', registre '997'.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'NS / No recuerdo', registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN26N
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN26. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after the birth was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> bathed for the first time?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'Immediately' or less than 1 hour, record '000'.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than 24 hours, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If '1 day' or 'next day', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">About how many hours after the delivery?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If '24 hours', probe to ensure best estimate of less than 24 hours or 1 day.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 24 hours or more, record days</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'Never bathed', record '997'.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'DK / Don't remember', record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN26. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después del parto se bañó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> por primera vez?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es 'Inmediatamente' o menos de 1 hora, registre '000'.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si son menos de 24 horas, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si '1 día' o 'día siguiente', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Aproximadamente cuántas horas después del parto?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es '24 horas', investigue para garantizar que la mejor estimación sea menos de 24 horas o 1 día.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si son 24 horas o más, registre los días</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'Nunca se bañó', registre '997'.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'NS / No recuerdo', registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN28
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN28. </span><span class="Qtxt">What was used to cut the cord?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN28. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué se utilizó para cortar el cordón?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN29
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN29. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was the instrument used to cut the cord boiled or sterilised prior to use?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN29. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿El instrumento utilizado para cortar el cordón fue hervido o esterilizado antes de su uso?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN30
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN30. </span><span class="Qtxt">After the cord was cut and until it fell off, was anything applied to the cord?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN30. </span><span class="Qtxt">Después de cortar el cordón y hasta que se cayó, ¿se aplicó algo al cordón?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN31
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN31. </span><span class="Qtxt">What was applied to the cord?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anything else?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN31. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué se aplicó al cordón?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Algo más?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN32
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN32. </span><span class="Qtxt">When <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> was born, was he very large, larger than average, average, smaller than average, or very small?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN32. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> nació, ¿era muy grande, más grande que el promedio, promedio, más pequeño que el promedio o muy pequeño?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN32. </span><span class="Qtxt">When <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> was born, was she very large, larger than average, average, smaller than average, or very small?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN32. </span><span class="Qtxt">Cuando nació <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, ¿era muy grande, más grande que el promedio, promedio, más pequeña que el promedio o muy pequeña?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN33
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN33. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> weighed at birth?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN33. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se pesó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> al nacer?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN34A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN34. </span><span class="Qtxt">How much did <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> weigh?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If <span class="QtxtC">a card</span> is available, record weight from <span class="QtxtC">card</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '9.9998' for Don't know.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN34. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto pesó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si hay <span class="QtxtC">una tarjeta</span> disponible, registre el peso de la <span class="QtxtC">tarjeta</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '9.9998' para No sé.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN34
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN34. </span><span class="Qtxt">How much did <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> weigh?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If <span class="QtxtC">a card</span> is available, record weight from <span class="QtxtC">card</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '9.998' for Don't know.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN34. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto pesó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
