              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '9.998' para No sé.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN35
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN35. </span><span class="Qtxt">Has your menstrual period returned since the birth of <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN35. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Ha regresado tu período menstrual desde el nacimiento de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN36
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN36. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you ever breastfeed <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN36. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguna vez amamantó a <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN37U
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN37. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after birth did you first put <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> to the breast?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than 1 hour, record '000'</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than 24 hours, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'DK / Don't remember', record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN37. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después del parto puso por primera vez <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> en el pecho?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de 1 hora, registre '000'</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si son menos de 24 horas, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">En caso contrario, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'NS / No recuerdo', registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN37N
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN37. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after birth did you first put <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> to the breast?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than 1 hour, record '000'</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than 24 hours, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If 'DK / Don't remember', record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN37. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después del parto puso por primera vez <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> en el pecho?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de 1 hora, registre '000'</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si son menos de 24 horas, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">En caso contrario, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si 'NS / No recuerdo', registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.MN38
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN38. </span><span class="Qtxt">In the first three days after delivery, was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> given anything at all other than breast milk to eat or drink, such as water, infant formula, or <span class="QtxtC">insert common drinks and foods, including ritual feeds that may be given to newborn infants</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">MN38. </span><span class="Qtxt">En los primeros tres días después del parto, ¿se le dio a <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> algo más que leche materna para comer o beber, como agua, fórmula infantil o <span class="QtxtC">insertar bebidas y alimentos comunes, incluidas las comidas rituales que se pueden dar a los recién nacidos</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN3U
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask you some questions about what happened in the hours and days after the birth of <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">You have said that you gave birth in <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>. How long did you stay there after the delivery?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hacerle algunas preguntas sobre lo que pasó en las horas y días posteriores al nacimiento de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Has dicho que diste a luz en <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>. ¿Cuánto tiempo permaneciste allí después del parto?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN3N
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask you some questions about what happened in the hours and days after the birth of <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">You have said that you gave birth in <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>. How long did you stay there after the delivery?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hacerle algunas preguntas sobre lo que pasó en las horas y días posteriores al nacimiento de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Has dicho que diste a luz en <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>. ¿Cuánto tiempo permaneciste allí después del parto?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN4. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to talk to you about checks on <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s health after delivery - for example, someone examining <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, checking the cord, or seeing if <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> is ok.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Before you left the <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>, did anyone check on <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s health?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría hablar con usted sobre las comprobaciones de la salud de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> después del parto; por ejemplo, que alguien examine <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, revise el cable o vea si <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> está bien.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Antes de abandonar <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>, ¿alguien comprobó el estado de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN5. </span><span class="Qtxt">And what about checks on <u>your</u> health - I mean, someone assessing your health, for example asking questions about your health or examining you?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Did anyone check on <u>your</u> health before you left <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Y qué pasa con los controles de <u>tu</u> salud? Es decir, ¿alguien que evalúa tu salud, por ejemplo, te hace preguntas sobre tu salud o te examina?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien comprobó <u>tu</u> salud antes de que te fueras de <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN6
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to talk to you about what happened after you left <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Did anyone check on <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s health after you left <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hablar contigo sobre lo que pasó después de que dejaste <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien comprobó el estado de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> después de que dejaste <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN8
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">You have already said that <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> assisted with the birth. Now I would like to talk to you about checks on <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s health after delivery, for example examining <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, checking the cord, or seeing if <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> is ok.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">After the delivery was over and before <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> left you, did <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> check on <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s health?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ya has dicho que <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> ayudó con el parto. Ahora me gustaría hablarte sobre las comprobaciones del estado de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> después del parto, por ejemplo examinando <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, revisando el cable o viendo si <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> está bien.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Después de que terminó el parto y antes de que <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> te dejara, ¿<span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> comprobó la salud de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN9
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN9. </span><span class="Qtxt">And did <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> check on <u>your</u> health before leaving for example asking questions about your health or examining you?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN9. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Y <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> verificó <u>tu</u> salud antes de partir, por ejemplo, para hacerte preguntas sobre tu salud o examinarte?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN10
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN10. </span><span class="Qtxt">After the <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> left you, did anyone check on the health of <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Después de que <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> lo dejó, ¿alguien verificó el estado de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN11
    conditions:
      - logic: chsex=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN11. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to talk to you about checks on <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s health after delivery - for example, someone examining <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, checking the cord, or seeing if the baby is ok.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">After <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> was delivered, did anyone check on his health?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría hablar con usted sobre los controles de la salud de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> después del parto; por ejemplo, que alguien examine a <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, revise el cordón umbilical o vea si el bebé está bien.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Después de que nació <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, ¿alguien revisó su salud?</span></p>
      - logic: chsex=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN11. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to talk to you about checks on <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s health after delivery - for example, someone examining <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, checking the cord, or seeing if the baby is ok.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">After <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> was delivered, did anyone check on her health?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría hablar con usted sobre los controles de la salud de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> después del parto; por ejemplo, que alguien examine a <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, revise el cordón umbilical o vea si el bebé está bien.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Después del parto de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, ¿alguien revisó su salud?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN12
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN12. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did such a check happen only once, or more than once?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN12. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Dicha verificación se realizó sólo una vez o más de una vez?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN13U
    conditions:
      - logic: PN12<>1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN13B. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after delivery did the first of these checks happen?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN13B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después de la entrega se realizó la primera de estas comprobaciones?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
      - logic: PN12=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN13A. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after delivery did that check happen?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN13A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después de la entrega se realizó ese cheque?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN13N
    conditions:
      - logic: PN12<>1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN13B. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after delivery did the first of these checks happen?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN13B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después de la entrega se realizó la primera de estas comprobaciones?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
      - logic: PN12=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN13A. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after delivery did that check happen?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record ''998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN13A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después de la entrega se realizó ese cheque?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre ''998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN14
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who checked on <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s health at that time?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN14. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién comprobó el estado de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> en ese momento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN15
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN15. </span><span class="Qtxt">Where did this check take place?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe to identify the type of place.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>If unable to determine whether public, private, or NGO</u>, write the name of the place and then temporarily record '76' until you learn the appropriate category for the response.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN15. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Dónde se realizó esta verificación?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda para identificar el tipo de lugar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>Si no puede determinar si es público, privado u ONG</u>, escriba el nombre del lugar y luego registre temporalmente '76' hasta que aprenda la categoría apropiada para la respuesta.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN17. </span><span class="Qtxt">After you left <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>, did anyone check on <u>your</u> health?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN17. </span><span class="Qtxt">Después de que dejaste <span class="REF">~~MN20Text~~</span>, ¿alguien revisó <u>tu</u> salud?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN19
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN19. </span><span class="Qtxt">After the delivery was over and <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> left, did anyone check on <u>your</u> health?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN19. </span><span class="Qtxt">Después de que terminó el parto y <span class="REF">~~MN19Text~~</span> se fue, ¿alguien revisó <u>tu</u> salud?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN20
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN20. </span><span class="Qtxt">After the birth of <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, did anyone check on <u>your</u> health, for example asking questions about your health or examining you?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Después del nacimiento de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, ¿alguien controló <u>tu</u> salud, por ejemplo, haciendo preguntas sobre tu salud o examinándote?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN21
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN21. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did such a check happen only once, or more than once?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN21. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Dicha verificación se realizó sólo una vez o más de una vez?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN22U
    conditions:
      - logic: PN21<>1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN22B. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after delivery did the first of these checks happen?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN22B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después de la entrega se realizó la primera de estas comprobaciones?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
      - logic: PN21=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN22A. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after delivery did that check happen?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN22A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después de la entrega se realizó ese cheque?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN22N
    conditions:
      - logic: PN21<>1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN22B. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after delivery did the first of these checks happen?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN22B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después de la entrega se realizó la primera de estas comprobaciones?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
      - logic: PN21=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN22A. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long after delivery did that check happen?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one day, record hours.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If less than one week, record days.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Otherwise, record weeks.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '998'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN22A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo después de la entrega se realizó ese cheque?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de un día, registre las horas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es menos de una semana, registre los días.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">De lo contrario, registra las semanas.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '998'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN23
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN23. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who checked on <u>your</u> health at that time?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN23. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién controlaba <u>tu</u> salud en ese momento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN24
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN24. </span><span class="Qtxt">Where did this check take place?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe to identify the type of place.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>If unable to determine whether public, private, or NGO</u>, write the name of the place and then temporarily record '76' until you learn the appropriate category for the response.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN24. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Dónde se realizó esta verificación?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sonda para identificar el tipo de lugar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>Si no puede determinar si es público, privado u ONG</u>, escriba el nombre del lugar y luego registre temporalmente '76' hasta que aprenda la categoría apropiada para la respuesta.</span></p>
  - name: PN25
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">PN25. </span><span class="Qtxt">During the first two days after birth, did any health care provider do any of the following either at home or at a facility:</span><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <span class="Qnum">PN25.</span><span class="Qtxt">Durante los primeros dos días después del nacimiento, ¿algún proveedor de atención médica hizo algo de lo siguiente, ya sea en casa o en un centro?:</span><p></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN25A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Examine <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s cord?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Examinar el cable de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN25B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Take the temperature of <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tomar la temperatura de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN25C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Counsel you on breastfeeding?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le aconseja sobre lactancia materna?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN27
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN27. </span><span class="Qtxt">During the first two days after birth, did any health care provider observe <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s breastfeeding?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN27. </span><span class="Qtxt">Durante los primeros dos días después del nacimiento, ¿algún proveedor de atención médica observó la lactancia materna de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN29
    conditions:
      - logic: MN33=1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN29A. </span><span class="Qtxt">You mentioned that <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> was weighed at birth. After that, was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> weighed again by a health care provider within two days?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN29A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Mencionaste que <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> fue pesado al nacer. Después de eso, ¿un proveedor de atención médica volvió a pesar <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> en un plazo de dos días?</span></p>
      - logic: MN33=2
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN29B. </span><span class="Qtxt">You mentioned that <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> was not weighed at birth. Was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> weighed at all by a health care provider within two days after birth?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN29B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Mencionaste que <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> no fue pesado al nacer. ¿Un proveedor de atención médica pesó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> dentro de los dos días posteriores al nacimiento?</span></p>
      - logic: MN33=8
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN29C. </span><span class="Qtxt">You mentioned that you do not know if <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> was weighed at birth. Was <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> weighed at all by a health care provider within two days after birth?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN29C. </span><span class="Qtxt">Mencionaste que no sabes si <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> fue pesado al nacer. ¿Un proveedor de atención médica pesó <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span> dentro de los dos días posteriores al nacimiento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.PN30
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN30. </span><span class="Qtxt">During the first two days after <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>'s birth, did any health care provider give you information on the symptoms that require you to take your sick child to a health facility for care?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">PN30. </span><span class="Qtxt">Durante los primeros dos días después del nacimiento de <span class="REF">~~CM18~~</span>, ¿algún proveedor de atención médica le brindó información sobre los síntomas que requieren que lleve a su hijo enfermo a un centro de salud para recibir atención?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.CP1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CP1. </span><span class="Qtxt">I would like to talk with you about another subject: family planning.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Are you pregnant now?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CP1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Me gustaría hablar contigo sobre otro tema: la planificación familiar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Estás embarazada ahora?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.CP2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CP2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Couples use various ways or methods to delay or avoid getting pregnant.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Are you currently doing something or using any method to delay or avoid getting pregnant?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CP2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Las parejas utilizan varias formas o métodos para retrasar o evitar quedar embarazada.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Estás haciendo algo o utilizando algún método actualmente para retrasar o evitar quedar embarazada?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.CP3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CP3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Have you ever done something or used any method to delay or avoid getting pregnant?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CP3. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguna vez has hecho algo o has utilizado algún método para retrasar o evitar quedar embarazada?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.CP4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CP4. </span><span class="Qtxt">What are you doing to delay or avoid a pregnancy?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Do not prompt.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If more than one method is mentioned, record each one.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">CP4. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué estás haciendo para retrasar o evitar un embarazo?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">No preguntar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si se menciona más de un método, registre cada uno.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to talk to you about your current pregnancy. When you got pregnant, did you want to get pregnant at that time?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hablarte sobre tu embarazo actual. Cuando quedaste embarazada, ¿querías quedar embarazada en ese momento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN4
    conditions:
      - logic: CM11=0
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN4A. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you want to have a baby later on or did you not want any children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN4A. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Querías tener un bebé más adelante o no querías tener hijos?</span></p>
      - logic: CM11>0
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN4B. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you want to have a baby later on or did you not want any more children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN4B. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Querías tener un bebé más adelante o no querías tener más hijos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask some questions about the future. After the child you are now expecting, would you like to have another child, or would you prefer not to have any more children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hacer algunas preguntas sobre el futuro. Después del hijo que ahora esperas, ¿te gustaría tener otro hijo o preferirías no tener más hijos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN7
    conditions:
      - logic: CM11=0
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN7. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask you some questions about the future. Would you like to have a child, or would you prefer not to have any children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN7. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hacerle algunas preguntas sobre el futuro. ¿Te gustaría tener un hijo o preferirías no tener hijos?</span></p>
      - logic: CM11>0
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN7. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask you some questions about the future. Would you like to have another child, or would you prefer not to have any more children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN7. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hacerle algunas preguntas sobre el futuro. ¿Te gustaría tener otro hijo o preferirías no tener más hijos?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN8U
    conditions:
      - logic: CM11=0
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long would you like to wait before the birth of a child?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer as stated by respondent.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '993' for Does not want to wait.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '994' for Says she cannot get pregnant.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '995' for After marriage.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '996' for Other.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '998' for Don't know.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer as stated by respondent.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo le gustaría esperar antes del nacimiento de un niño?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre la respuesta tal como la expresó el encuestado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '993' de No quiere esperar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '994' para Dice que no puede quedar embarazada.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '995' para Después del matrimonio.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '996' para Otro.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '998' para No sé.</span></p><p><span class="Itxt">Registre la respuesta tal como fue expresada por el encuestado.</span></p>
      - logic: CM11>0
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long would you like to wait before the birth of another child?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer as stated by respondent.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '993' for Does not want to wait.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '994' for Says she cannot get pregnant.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '995' for After marriage.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '996' for Other.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '998' for Don't know.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo le gustaría esperar antes del nacimiento de otro hijo?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre la respuesta tal como la expresó el encuestado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '993' de No quiere esperar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '994' para Dice que no puede quedar embarazada.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '995' para Después del matrimonio.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '996' para Otro.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '998' para No sé.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN8N
    conditions:
      - logic: CM11=0
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long would you like to wait before the birth of a child?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer as stated by respondent.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '993' for Does not want to wait.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '994' for Says she cannot get pregnant.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '995' for After marriage.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '996' for Other.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '998' for Don't know.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo le gustaría esperar antes del nacimiento de un niño?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre la respuesta tal como la expresó el encuestado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '993' de No quiere esperar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '994' para Dice que no puede quedar embarazada.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '995' para Después del matrimonio.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '996' para Otro.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '998' para No sé.</span></p>
      - logic: CM11>0
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long would you like to wait before the birth of another child?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer as stated by respondent.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '993' for Does not want to wait.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '994' for Says she cannot get pregnant.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '995' for After marriage.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '996' for Other.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '998' for Don't know.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN8. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo le gustaría esperar antes del nacimiento de otro hijo?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre la respuesta tal como la expresó el encuestado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '993' de No quiere esperar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '994' para Dice que no puede quedar embarazada.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '995' para Después del matrimonio.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '996' para Otro.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registre '998' para No sé.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN11
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN11. </span><span class="Qtxt">Do you think you are physically able to get pregnant at this time?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN11. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Crees que estás físicamente capacitada para quedar embarazada en este momento?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN12
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN12. </span><span class="Qtxt">Why do you think you are not physically able to get pregnant?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN12. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Por qué crees que no eres físicamente capaz de quedar embarazada?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN14U
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN14. </span><span class="Qtxt">When did your last menstrual period start?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer using the same unit stated by the respondent.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If '1 year', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">How many months ago?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '993' for In menopause / has had hysterectomy.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '994' for Before last birth.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '995' for Never menstruated.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN14. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuándo comenzó tu último período menstrual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registra la respuesta utilizando la misma unidad indicada por el encuestado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si '1 año', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Hace cuántos meses?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '993' para En menopausia/ha tenido histerectomía.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '994' de Antes del último nacimiento.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '995' para Nunca menstruado.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN14N
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN14. </span><span class="Qtxt">When did your last menstrual period start?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record the answer using the same unit stated by the respondent.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If '1 year', probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">How many months ago?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '993' for In menopause / has had hysterectomy.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '994' for Before last birth.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record '995' for Never menstruated.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN14. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuándo comenzó tu último período menstrual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registra la respuesta utilizando la misma unidad indicada por el encuestado.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si '1 año', indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Hace cuántos meses?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '993' para En menopausia/ha tenido histerectomía.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '994' de Antes del último nacimiento.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registro '995' para Nunca menstruado.</span></p>
  - name: UN16
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN16. </span><span class="Qtxt">During your last menstrual period, did you have trouble participating in the following activities due to your period.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">If the respondent would not normally attend such activity, record ‘7’</span></p><p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN16.</span><span class="Qtxt">Durante su último período menstrual, ¿tuvo problemas para participar en las siguientes actividades debido a su período?</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">Si el encuestado normalmente no asistiría a dicha actividad, registre '7'</span></p><p></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN16A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Work?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Trabajas?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN16B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Education and training?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Educación y formación?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN16C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Social activities outside school or work?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Actividades sociales fuera de la escuela o el trabajo?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN17. </span><span class="Qtxt">During your last menstrual period, did you worry that someone would see you while you were changing menstrual materials <u>at home</u>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN17. </span><span class="Qtxt">Durante tu último período menstrual, ¿te preocupaba que alguien te viera mientras cambiabas los materiales menstruales <u>en casa</u>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN18
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN18. </span><span class="Qtxt">During your last menstrual period, did you have enough menstrual materials to change them as often as you wanted to throughout your menstrual period?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Regular (non-absorbent) underwear are not considered menstrual materials. If the woman did not use any menstrual materials, probe to learn if wanted to use them. If she did not want to use any, record “Yes, enough”.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Durante su último período menstrual, ¿tuvo suficientes materiales menstruales para cambiarlos con la frecuencia que deseaba durante su período menstrual?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">La ropa interior normal (no absorbente) no se considera material menstrual. Si la mujer no usó ningún material menstrual, indague para saber si quería usarlos. Si no quiso usar ninguno, registre “Sí, suficiente”.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN19
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN19. </span><span class="Qtxt">During your last menstrual period, were you able to reduce your menstruation-related pain when you needed to?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN19. </span><span class="Qtxt">Durante su último período menstrual, ¿pudo reducir el dolor relacionado con la menstruación cuando lo necesitaba?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN20
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN20. </span><span class="Qtxt">If you were to have a concern about your menstrual period, would you feel comfortable seeking help from a health care provider such as a school nurse, <span class="QtxtC">community health worker</span>, or doctor?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Si tuviera alguna inquietud sobre su período menstrual, ¿se sentiría cómoda buscando ayuda de un proveedor de atención médica, como una enfermera escolar, un <span class="QtxtC">trabajador de salud comunitario</span> o un médico?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.UN21
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN21. </span><span class="Qtxt">Before you had your first menstrual period, did you know about menstruation?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">UN21. </span><span class="Qtxt">Antes de tener tu primer período menstrual, ¿sabías acerca de la menstruación?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Have you ever heard of female circumcision?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG1. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Has oído hablar alguna vez de la circuncisión femenina?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG2. </span><span class="Qtxt">In some countries, there is a practice in which a girl may have part of her genitals cut.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Have you ever heard about this practice?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG2. </span><span class="Qtxt">En algunos países, existe la práctica de cortar parte de sus genitales a una niña.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguna vez has oído hablar de esta práctica?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Have you yourself ever been circumcised?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG3. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguna vez has sido circuncidado?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask you what was done to you at that time.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Was any flesh removed from the genital area?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría preguntarte qué te hicieron en ese momento.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Se extrajo algo de carne del área genital?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was the genital area just nicked without removing any flesh?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se cortó simplemente el área genital sin quitar nada de carne?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG6
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was the genital area sewn closed?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If necessary, probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was it sealed?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG6. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Se cosió el área genital para cerrarla?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es necesario, indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Estaba sellado?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG7
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG7. </span><span class="Qtxt">How old were you when you were circumcised?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If the respondent does not know the exact age, probe to get an estimate.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know / Don't remember, record '98'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG7. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tenías cuando te circuncidaron?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si el encuestado no sabe la edad exacta, indague para obtener una estimación.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no sabe/no recuerda, registre '98'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG8
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG8. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who performed the circumcision?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG8. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién realizó la circuncisión?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG10
    conditions:
      - logic: FG9 = 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure that I have this right, you have <span class="REF">~~FG9~~</span> living daughter. Is this correct?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para asegurarme de que tengo este derecho, tienes <span class="REF">~~FG9~~</span> hija viva. ¿Es esto correcto?</span></p>
      - logic: FG9 >1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure that I have this right, you have <span class="REF">~~FG9~~</span> living daughters. Is this correct?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG10. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para asegurarme de que tengo este derecho, tienes <span class="REF">~~FG9~~</span> hijas vivas. ¿Es esto correcto?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG14
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Name of daughter</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Nombre de la hija</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG15
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG15. </span><span class="Qtxt">How old is <span class="REF">~~FG14~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG15. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuántos años tiene <span class="REF">~~FG14~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG17. </span><span class="Qtxt">Is <span class="REF">~~FG14~~</span> circumcised?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG17. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Está <span class="REF">~~FG14~~</span> circuncidado?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG18
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG18. </span><span class="Qtxt">How old was <span class="REF">~~FG14~~</span> when this occurred?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If the respondent does not know the age, probe to get an estimate.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If Don't know, record '98'.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG18. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué edad tenía <span class="REF">~~FG14~~</span> cuando ocurrió esto?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si el encuestado no conoce la edad, indague para obtener una estimación.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si no lo sabe, registre '98'.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG19
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG19. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask you what was done to <span class="REF">~~FG14~~</span> at that time.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Was any flesh removed from the genital area?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG19. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría preguntarle qué se hizo con <span class="REF">~~FG14~~</span> en ese momento.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Se extrajo algo de carne del área genital?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG20
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was her genital area just nicked without removing any flesh?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG20. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le cortaron el área genital sin quitarle nada de carne?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG21
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG21. </span><span class="Qtxt">Was her genital area sewn closed?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If necessary, probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Was it sealed?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG21. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Le cosieron el área genital para cerrarla?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si es necesario, indague: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Estaba sellado?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG22
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG22. </span><span class="Qtxt">Who performed the circumcision?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG22. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Quién realizó la circuncisión?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.FG24
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG24. </span><span class="Qtxt">Do you think this practice should be continued or should it be discontinued?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">FG24. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Crees que esta práctica debería continuarse o debería descontinuarse?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.HP2
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask some questions about human papillomavirus or HPV vaccinations.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Have you ever received a vaccination against HPV, that is, an injection in the <span class="QtxtC">left upper arm</span> to protect against cervical cancer?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP2. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría hacer algunas preguntas sobre las vacunas contra el virus del papiloma humano o el VPH.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguna vez ha recibido una vacuna contra el VPH, es decir, una inyección en la <span class="QtxtC">parte superior del brazo izquierdo</span> para proteger contra el cáncer de cuello uterino?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.HP3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP3. </span><span class="Qtxt">The HPV vaccine is also referred to as <span class="QtxtC">Cervarix/Gardasil</span> and is commonly given at school/a medical facility to girls between the ages of 9 and 14.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">If you have received an HPV vaccination, you may have been given a <span class="QtxtC">vaccination card</span> or have another document where the information is recorded.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Just to confirm, have you ever received a vaccination against HPV?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP3. </span><span class="Qtxt">La vacuna contra el VPH también se conoce como <span class="QtxtC">Cervarix/Gardasil</span> y comúnmente se administra en la escuela o en un centro médico a niñas de entre 9 y 14 años.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Si has recibido la vacuna contra el VPH, es posible que te hayan entregado una <span class="QtxtC">tarjeta de vacunación</span> o tengas otro documento donde conste la información.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">Solo para confirmar, ¿ha recibido alguna vez la vacuna contra el VPH?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.HP4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP4. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you ever receive an HPV vaccination card?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">It is not necessary to see evidence of the vaccination(s), but if the respondent, for instance, cannot remember the number of doses it may be helpful to see the <span class="ItxtC">card</span> or document.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP4. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Recibiste alguna vez una tarjeta de vacunación contra el VPH?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">No es necesario ver evidencia de la(s) vacuna(s), pero si el encuestado, por ejemplo, no recuerda el número de dosis, puede ser útil ver la <span class="ItxtC">tarjeta</span> o documento.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.HP5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP5. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you receive one or two doses of the HPV vaccine?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">If more than 2 doses, record ‘2’.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Recibiste una o dos dosis de la vacuna contra el VPH?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Si son más de 2 dosis, registre “2”.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.HP6
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP6. </span><span class="Qtxt">Where did you receive your most recent HPV vaccination?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>If unable to determine whether public, private or NGO</u>, write the name of the place and then temporarily record ‘76’ until you learn the appropriate category for the response.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">HP6. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Dónde recibió su vacuna contra el VPH más reciente?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt"><u>Si no puede determinar si es público, privado u ONG</u>, escriba el nombre del lugar y luego registre temporalmente '76' hasta que aprenda la categoría apropiada para la respuesta.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU3
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">TU2. </span><span class="Itxt">Begin by asking the respondent what time she woke up the day before the interview and what time she went to sleep. Then ask her to list the activities she did during the day in chronological order. For each activity, record the appropriate code in TU7, ask TU8-TU10 and, if applicable, proceed to ask any follow-up questions. After recording all information relative to an activity, you will be led back to TU7 to ask what she did next. Once she mentions she went to sleep for the night, do not record anything else. Finally, to ensure everything she did yesterday has been captured, TU18 will prompt you to read all activities recorded and ask if anything is missing. If yes, enter the code, time and/or duration for each activity that was not previously mentioned or captured.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU3. </span><span class="Qtxt">I will now ask you about what you did yesterday, between waking up in the morning and going to bed at night for sleeping. You can include anything you did. These can include active tasks such as studying and eating or passive activities such as relaxing or thinking.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Inum">TU2. </span><span class="Itxt">Comience preguntando al encuestado a qué hora se despertó el día antes de la entrevista y a qué hora se fue a dormir. Luego pídale que enumere las actividades que realizó durante el día en orden cronológico. Para cada actividad, registrar el código correspondiente en TU7, preguntar TU8-TU10 y, en su caso, proceder a realizar las preguntas de seguimiento. Después de registrar toda la información relativa a una actividad, regresará a TU7 para preguntarle qué hizo a continuación. Una vez que ella mencione que se fue a dormir por la noche, no registre nada más. Finalmente, para garantizar que se haya capturado todo lo que hizo ayer, TU18 le pedirá que lea todas las actividades registradas y le preguntará si falta algo. En caso afirmativo, ingrese el código, la hora y/o la duración de cada actividad que no se haya mencionado o capturado previamente.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU3. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora te preguntaré qué hiciste ayer, entre despertarte por la mañana y acostarte por la noche para dormir. Puedes incluir cualquier cosa que hayas hecho. Estas pueden incluir tareas activas como estudiar y comer o actividades pasivas como relajarse o pensar.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU4
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU4. </span><span class="Qtxt">What time did you wake up yesterday?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record as HH.MM</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU4. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿A qué hora te levantaste ayer?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registrar como HH.MM</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU5
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU5. </span><span class="Qtxt">What time did you go to sleep for the night yesterday?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record as HH.MM</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU5. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿A qué hora te acostaste ayer por la noche?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registrar como HH.MM</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU7
    conditions:
      - logic: TU6 = 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">First activity starting at ~~stactiv~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU7. </span><span class="Qtxt">What did you do first?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Primera actividad comenzando en ~~stactiv~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU7. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué hiciste primero?</span></p>
      - logic: TU6 > 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ starting at ~~stactiv~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU7. </span><span class="Qtxt">What did you do next?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ comenzando en ~~stactiv~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU7. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué hiciste después?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU9X
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU9.-TU10. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long did you do this activity? What time did this activity end?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Select response type</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU9.-TU10. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo hiciste esta actividad? ¿A qué hora terminó esta actividad?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Seleccione el tipo de respuesta</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU9
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU9. </span><span class="Qtxt">How long did you do this activity?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record as HH.MM</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU9. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cuánto tiempo hiciste esta actividad?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registrar como HH.MM</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU10
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU10. </span><span class="Qtxt">What time did this activity end?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record as HH.MM</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU10. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿A qué hora terminó esta actividad?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registrar como HH.MM</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU12
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU12. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you play online?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU12. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Jugaste online?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU13
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU13. </span><span class="Qtxt">With whom did you play?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record all mentioned. Do not record C, D if TU12=2.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU13. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Con quién jugaste?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registrar todo lo mencionado. No registre C, D si TU12=2.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU14
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU14. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you watch this online?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU14. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Viste esto en línea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU15
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU15. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you get the news online?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU15. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Recibiste la noticia en línea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU16
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU16. </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you engage in this activity or do this activity online?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU16. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Participó en esta actividad o realizó esta actividad en línea?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU17
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Activity ~~TU6~~ at ~~stactiv~~ : ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU17. </span><span class="Qtxt">How were your lessons delivered?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Probe: </span><span class="Qtxt">Anyone else?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Record all mentioned.</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Itxt">Actividad ~~TU6~~ en ~~stactiv~~: ~~TU7A~~</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU17. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Cómo se impartieron sus lecciones?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Sondeo: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Alguien más?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Registra todo lo mencionado.</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.TU18
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Just to make sure I have this right I will now repeat all the activities you have listed in chronological order. I would like you to think if there is any activity you did yesterday, between waking up in the morning and going to bed at night for sleeping, that you forgot to mention.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Read aloud the list of activities reported and ask: </span><span class="Qtxt">Did you do anything else that we have not recorded yet?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">TU18. </span><span class="Qtxt">Solo para asegurarme de que tengo esto correcto, ahora repetiré todas las actividades que has enumerado en orden cronológico. Me gustaría que pensaras si hay alguna actividad que hiciste ayer, entre despertarte por la mañana y acostarte por la noche para dormir, que olvidaste mencionar.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Itxt">Lea en voz alta la lista de actividades reportadas y pregunte: </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Hiciste algo más que no hayamos registrado todavía?</span></p>
  - name: DV1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DV1. </span><span class="Qtxt">Sometimes a husband is annoyed or angered by things that his wife does. </span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">In your opinion, is a husband justified in hitting or beating his wife in the following situations:</span><p></p></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">DV1.</span><span class="Qtxt">A veces un marido se molesta o enoja por cosas que hace su esposa. </span></p><p><span class="Qtxt">En su opinión, ¿está justificado que un marido golpee o golpee a su esposa en las siguientes situaciones:</span><p></p></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.DV1A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">If she goes out without telling him?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Si ella sale sin avisarle?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.DV1B
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">If she neglects the children?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Si descuida a los niños?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.DV1C
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">If she argues with him?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Si ella discute con él?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.DV1D
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">If she refuses to have sex with him?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Si ella se niega a tener relaciones sexuales con él?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.DV1E
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">If she burns the food?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Si quema la comida?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT20
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">VT20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Now I would like to ask you about how safe you feel in certain situations.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">How safe do you feel walking alone in your neighbourhood after dark?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">VT20. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora me gustaría preguntarte qué tan seguro te sientes en determinadas situaciones.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué tan seguro te sientes al caminar solo en tu vecindario después del anochecer?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT21
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">VT21. </span><span class="Qtxt">How safe do you feel when you are at home alone after dark?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">VT21. </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué tan seguro te sientes cuando estás solo en casa después del anochecer?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23A
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">VT23. </span><span class="Qtxt">I will now ask you about discrimination. Discrimination happens when you are treated less favourably compared to others or harassed because of the way you look, where you come from, what you believe, or for other reasons.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">In <span class="QtxtC">Country</span>, do you feel that you <u>personally</u> experienced any form of discrimination or harassment during the last 3 years, that is, since <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span> based on any of the following grounds?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">Your sex, such as you are a man or a woman?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">VT23. </span><span class="Qtxt">Ahora le preguntaré sobre la discriminación. La discriminación ocurre cuando te tratan de manera menos favorable en comparación con los demás o cuando te acosan por tu apariencia, de dónde vienes, lo que crees o por otras razones.</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qtxt">En <span class="QtxtC">País</span>, ¿siente que ha experimentado <u>personalmente</u> alguna forma de discriminación o acoso durante los últimos 3 años, es decir, desde <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span> por alguno de los siguientes motivos?</span></p>
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Tu sexo, como si eres hombre o mujer?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23A1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A1] </span><span class="Qtxt">How about since <span class="REF">~~yyyymmminus1~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[A1] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué tal desde <span class="REF">~~yyyymmminus1~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23B
    conditions:
      - logic: VT23A = 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Coming back to your experience since <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, how about on grounds of Your age, such as you are perceived to be too young or too old?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Volviendo a tu experiencia desde <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, ¿qué tal en función de tu edad, como que te perciben como demasiado joven o demasiado viejo?</span></p>
      - logic: VT23A <> 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">Your age, such as you are perceived to be too young or too old?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Su edad, por ejemplo, si se le percibe como demasiado joven o demasiado viejo?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23B1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B1] </span><span class="Qtxt">How about since <span class="REF">~~yyyymmminus1~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[B1] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué tal desde <span class="REF">~~yyyymmminus1~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23C
    conditions:
      - logic: VT23B = 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Coming back to your experience since <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, how about on grounds of Your disability or health status, such as having difficulty in seeing, hearing, walking or moving, concentrating, or communicating, or having a disease or other health conditions and no reasonable accommodation provided for it?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Volviendo a su experiencia desde <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, ¿qué tal por su discapacidad o estado de salud, como tener dificultad para ver, oír, caminar o moverse, concentrarse o comunicarse, o tener una enfermedad u otras condiciones de salud y no se le han proporcionado adaptaciones razonables para ello?</span></p>
      - logic: VT23B <> 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">Your disability or health status, such as having difficulty in seeing, hearing, walking or moving, concentrating, or communicating, or having a disease or other health conditions and no reasonable accommodation provided for it?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Su discapacidad o estado de salud, como tener dificultad para ver, oír, caminar o moverse, concentrarse o comunicarse, o tener una enfermedad u otras condiciones de salud y no se le han proporcionado adaptaciones razonables para ello?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23C1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C1] </span><span class="Qtxt">How about since <span class="REF">~~yyyymmminus1~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[C1] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué tal desde <span class="REF">~~yyyymmminus1~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23D
    conditions:
      - logic: VT23C = 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">Coming back to your experience since <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, how about on grounds of Your ethnicity, colour, or language, such as skin colour or physical appearance, ethnic origin or way of dressing, culture, traditions, native language or accent, indigenous status, or being of African descent?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">Volviendo a su experiencia desde <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, ¿qué tal por motivos de su origen étnico, color o idioma, como color de piel o apariencia física, origen étnico o forma de vestir, cultura, tradiciones, lengua o acento nativo, condición indígena o ser de ascendencia africana?</span></p>
      - logic: VT23C <> 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">Your ethnicity, colour, or language, such as skin colour or physical appearance, ethnic origin or way of dressing, culture, traditions, native language or accent, indigenous status, or being of African descent?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Su origen étnico, color o idioma, como color de piel o apariencia física, origen étnico o forma de vestir, cultura, tradiciones, idioma o acento nativo, condición indígena o ser de ascendencia africana?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23D1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D1] </span><span class="Qtxt">How about since <span class="REF">~~yyyymmminus1~~</span>?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[D1] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Qué tal desde <span class="REF">~~yyyymmminus1~~</span>?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23E
    conditions:
      - logic: VT23D = 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">Coming back to your experience since <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, how about on grounds of Your migration status, such as nationality or national origin, country of birth, migrant status, being an undocumented migrant, or stateless person?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">Volviendo a su experiencia desde <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, ¿qué tal por motivos de su estatus migratorio, como nacionalidad u origen nacional, país de nacimiento, estatus migratorio, ser migrante indocumentado o apátrida?</span></p>
      - logic: VT23D <> 1
        questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">Your migration status, such as nationality or national origin, country of birth, migrant status, being an undocumented migrant, or stateless person?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[E] </span><span class="Qtxt">¿Su situación migratoria, como nacionalidad u origen nacional, país de nacimiento, condición de migrante, ser migrante indocumentado o apátrida?</span></p>
  - name: MICS7WM.VT23E1
    conditions:
      - questionText:
          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
