          EN:
            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[J] </span><span class="Qtxt">Coming back to your experience since <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, how about on grounds of Your sexual orientation or gender identity, such as being attracted to a person of the same sex, self-identifying differently from sex assigned at birth or as being sexually, bodily, or gender diverse?</span></p>
