            format: HTML
            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[K] </span><span class="Qtxt">Coming back to your experience since <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, how about on grounds of Your political opinion, such as expressing political views, defending the rights of others, being a member or not of a political party or trade union?</span></p>
          ES:
            format: HTML
