            text: |
              <p><span class="Qnum">[X] </span><span class="Qtxt">Since <span class="REF">~~WM6Y-3~~</span>, do you feel that you personally experienced any other form of discrimination or harassment in <span class="QtxtC">Country</span>?</span></p>
