              <span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">BEST AND SAFEST WAY FOR COUNSELOR TO FIND RESPONDENT (E.G. BY PHONE, IN PERSON AT HOME/ANOTHER LOCATION):</span><p></p>
          ES:
